		{
			"id": "SMv26rXH",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 810.6392612802744,
			"y": -223.8062013138567,
			"width": 553.3914794921875,
			"height": 80,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
			"backgroundColor": "transparent",
			"fillStyle": "solid",
			"strokeWidth": 2,
			"strokeStyle": "solid",
			"roughness": 1,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [],
			"frameId": null,
			"index": "b23",
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 85620168,
			"version": 124,
			"versionNonce": 703020216,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": null,
			"updated": 1783671037472,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Queues: In a queue-based system, messages are sent to a queue, and\none or more consumers (subscribers) process messages from the queue.\nMessages are typically consumed in a first-in, first-out (FIFO) order.\nEach message is typically processed by only one consumer",
			"rawText": "Queues: In a queue-based system, messages are sent to a queue, and one or more consumers (subscribers) process messages from the queue. Messages are typically consumed in a first-in, first-out (FIFO) order. Each message is typically processed by only one consumer",
			"fontSize": 16,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "Queues: In a queue-based system, messages are sent to a queue, and one or more consumers (subscribers) process messages from the queue. Messages are typically consumed in a first-in, first-out (FIFO) order. Each message is typically processed by only one consumer",
			"autoResize": false,
			"lineHeight": 1.25
		},
		{
			"id": "1TWl6wH4",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 812.1204610449407,
			"y": -67.52848003072222,
			"width": 541.9994506835938,
			"height": 100,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
			"backgroundColor": "transparent",
			"fillStyle": "solid",
			"strokeWidth": 2,
			"strokeStyle": "solid",
			"roughness": 1,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [],
			"frameId": null,
			"index": "b24",
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 2049464,
			"version": 95,
			"versionNonce": 469295288,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": null,
			"updated": 1783671035653,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Pub/Sub System: In a Pub/Sub system, messages are published to a\ntopic, and multiple subscribers can receive those messages. Publishers\nand subscribers are decoupled, and subscribers express interest in\nspecific topics. When a message is published to a topic, all interested\nsubscribers receive a copy of the message.",
			"rawText": "Pub/Sub System: In a Pub/Sub system, messages are published to a topic, and multiple subscribers can receive those messages. Publishers and subscribers are decoupled, and subscribers express interest in specific topics. When a message is published to a topic, all interested subscribers receive a copy of the message.",
			"fontSize": 16,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "Pub/Sub System: In a Pub/Sub system, messages are published to a topic, and multiple subscribers can receive those messages. Publishers and subscribers are decoupled, and subscribers express interest in specific topics. When a message is published to a topic, all interested subscribers receive a copy of the message.",
			"autoResize": false,
			"lineHeight": 1.25
		},
